---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Contact SOCHSE about a difficult workflow, fragmented data, digital presence, or focused software problem."
  path="/contact/"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Contact"
    title="Bring the question. We can work out the shape."
    description="Contact SOCHSE about a business problem, a website, an automation idea, a data challenge, or focused software. You do not need a finished brief."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="site-container grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.7fr]">
      <article class="card p-8 sm:p-10">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-faint)]">Start a conversation</p>
        <a class="mt-4 block text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em] text-[var(--accent)] sm:text-3xl" href="mailto:sochsecompass@gmail.com">
          sochsecompass@gmail.com
        </a>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--text-soft)]">
          Email is the simplest way to begin. Tell me what you are trying to
          improve, what is getting in the way, and what a useful outcome would
          look like. A rough note is enough.
        </p>
        <a
          class="button button-primary mt-8"
          href="mailto:sochsecompass@gmail.com?subject=SOCHSE%20consulting%20enquiry"
        >
          Write an email
        </a>
      </article>

      <aside class="card p-8">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-faint)]">Good reasons to write</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--text-soft)]">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-[var(--accent)]">01</span><span>You need a clearer technology or product direction.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-[var(--accent)]">02</span><span>A website, workflow, or existing tool needs improvement.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-[var(--accent)]">03</span><span>You have an idea involving data, automation, AI, web, or mobile.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-[var(--accent)]">04</span><span>You know the outcome you want, but not what should be built.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section divider">
    <div class="site-container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="eyebrow">What happens next</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">A practical first conversation.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          I will read the context, ask the questions that matter, and help
          separate the immediate need from the larger possibilities. If there
          is a useful fit, we can define a small first step.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
